					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-348751#post-1150204</guid>
				<title>Containment vs capture</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-348751/scp-569#post-1150204</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 13 May 2011 00:47:11 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Voct</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>392303</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>We don't need to submerge these things in liquid nitrogen to keep them contained. We only need liquid nitrogen to incapacitate them if they get angry.</p> <p>To keep them inert and contained, we can use ice water.</p> 
				 	]]>
